    "description": "Part of the Baha Mar resort on Cable Beach along the Atlantic Ocean, this posh, tranquil hotel is 11 km from Lynden Pindling International Airport.\nAiry, sophisticated rooms feature free Wi-Fi, flat-screens, minibars and Nespresso machines, plus patios. Some offer ocean views. The 1- to 3-bedroom suites add living rooms and kitchen/dining areas. The 3- and 6-bedroom beachfront villas have private pools. Butler service is available.\nThere are 2 upscale restaurants, plus a chic bar and a tea lounge. Other amenities include 2 outdoor pools, a gym and a luxe spa, as well as an 18-hole golf course, water sports, 9 tennis courts and a private beach."
